                    "code": "\r\nexpA(x0)\n{\n\tx = 0.999996 + (0.031261316 + (0.00048274797 + 0.000006 * x0) * x0) * x0;\n\tx *= x; x *= x; x *= x; x *= x; x *= x;\n\treturn x;\n}\n\r\ntauA(t)                                     // t must be minimum 0.001 seconds\n{\n\ty = expA(-1 / (t * samplerate));\n\treturn y + 0.000128;\n}\r\n\r\nexpsmooth(x, t)\t\t// x = value\t\t\t// t is smooth time in seconds\n{\n\tHistory w(0), init0(1);\n\tz = tauA(t);\n\tz = z * (1 - init0);\n\ty = (z * w) + (x * (1 - z));\n\tw = y;\n\tinit0 = 0;\n\treturn y;\n}\r\n\r\nout1    = expsmooth(in1, in2*0.001);\r\n\r\n",
